# Host bin/obj must stay out: their restore files hold Windows paths and break the Linux build.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.claude
**/*.*proj.user
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/node_modules
.github
publish
out

**/.git
!.git/HEAD
!.git/config
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/heads/**
